  "description": "Introducing the all-new Leader 801 Frameset: Engineered for Speed. Committed over a year of development, the 801, with its fully integrated cable routing, creates a clean, aerodynamic profile, minimizing drag and maximizing your performance. Our fully integrated cable routing delivers a sleek, aerodynamic design that reduces drag and boosts your performance. The 801 frameset is UCI-approved, allowing you to race confidently in any UCI-sanctioned event competitions. This race-inspired frameset is crafted from lightweight 6061 aluminum, offering an ideal balance of stiffness for efficient power transfer and compliance for all-day ride comfort. The 1-1/4” straight head tube ensures razor-sharp handling and confident cornering, giving you complete control on the road. Race-proven geometry maximizes your power output, helping you push past your limits. Thru-axles at the front and rear enhance stiffness and stability, giving you a more responsive ride. Designed specifically for disc brakes, this bike guarantees powerful, consistent stopping power in any condition. Generous tire clearance accommodates up to 700x34c’ tires, offering versatility for varied road surfaces. Available in two stunning finishes: a classic silver and a striking chameleon green-to-purple fade. 801 is compatible with Shimano, SRAM and Campagnolo system. Disc brake specific Thru-axle 27.2 Seat Post BSA 68mm threaded bottom bracket Stock headset included and is compatible with any stem and bar of your choice Internal routing 1 1/4 straight head tube Aluminum frame weight 1588g Full carbon fork weight 352g Maximum tire width 34mm Compatible with our 801 fully integrated bar\nComes with frame, fork, headset, axles, and seat clamp ISO4210 and UCI certified",
